{% include "nav.njk" %}
{% include "section-nav.njk" %}

<main class="shl">
  <p class="shl-eyebrow">Share <span class="stage-chip">Alpha</span></p>
  <h1 class="shl-title">Send a file, encrypted.</h1>
  <p class="shl-lede">Your browser encrypts the file before it leaves your device. The link you send carries the encryption key; Refueler only ever holds scrambled bytes. No account or email needed.</p>
  <p class="shl-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://share.refueler.io/">Open Share</a></p>

  <section class="shl-alpha" id="alpha" aria-labelledby="alpha-title">
    <h2 class="shl-h2" id="alpha-title">What alpha means</h2>
    <p>Share works, but it is still being built, so:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Things will break and change, sometimes from one week to the next.</li>
      <li>Links made now may stop working before version 1.0.</li>
      <li>Don’t send anything you can’t send again.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

